      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 309.04,
      "end_seconds": 325.95,
      "duration_seconds": 16.91,
      "text": "drink plenty of water and avoid calcium supplements until the results we'll refer you to the endocrine clinic keep an eye out, and if the symptoms get worse, call us the same day or go to emergency"
    },
